# EXAMPLE FILE. Copy to removed.txt on the build server (removed.txt is gitignored,
# because it names people who exercised a privacy request).
#
# Contributors who have asked for their profile picture to be removed.
#
# One entry per line: either the numeric userid or the handle, case-insensitive.
# "#" starts a comment. Both build/extract_media.py (never fetch) and
# build/generate.py (never render) read this file, so an entry here keeps the
# picture out of the archive permanently, including after future rebuilds.
#
# Requests come to info@openpreservation.org. See the "Handling a removal
# request" section of README.md for the full procedure.
#
# Example:
#   todrobbins        # requested 2026-08-18
